    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3241270/extras/000330a9a9251d989e3c2a00287a23b7.poster.avif?t=1750510955\" width=600 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3241270/extras/000330a9a9251d989e3c2a00287a23b7.webm?t=1750510955\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3241270/extras/000330a9a9251d989e3c2a00287a23b7.mp4?t=1750510955\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[ About ]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Into the Void</strong> is a <strong>fast-paced retro FPS game</strong> inspired by the adrenaline-pumping experiences of Post Void and ULTRAKILL. <br>It features fast-paced action, intense combat, and the thrill of audacious gameplay with a distinctive, unique art style. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3241270/extras/fc8d937c32df9e38b414df2d0ac4589c.poster.avif?t=1750510955\" width=600 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3241270/extras/fc8d937c32df9e38b414df2d0ac4589c.webm?t=1750510955\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3241270/extras/fc8d937c32df9e38b414df2d0ac4589c.mp4?t=1750510955\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[ Features ]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Clean and fast-paced, thrilling gameplay  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Unique weapons and health systems, with various movement techniques and power-ups to break speed limits  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Stylish black &amp; white art styles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3241270/extras/ac6a988b672e40ba8a83e9eec00756dc.poster.avif?t=1750510955\" width=600 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3241270/extras/ac6a988b672e40ba8a83e9eec00756dc.webm?t=1750510955\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3241270/extras/ac6a988b672e40ba8a83e9eec00756dc.mp4?t=1750510955\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[ And More... ]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Various challenge modes! (No death, no kill, etc.)  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Tons of hidden secrets!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A story that changes based on your playstyle!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And also...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>DESTROY THE CORE DESTROY THE CORE DESTROY THE CORE DESTROY THE CORE DESTROY THE CORE DESTROY THE CORE</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>DESTROY THE CORE DESTROY THE CORE DESTROY THE CORE DESTROY THE CORE DESTROY THE CORE DESTROY THE CORE</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>DESTROY THE CORE DESTROY THE CORE DESTROY THE CORE DESTROY THE CORE DESTROY THE CORE DESTROY THE CORE</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3241270/extras/2be233373119dbb6fb34e456cf962e39.avif?t=1750510955\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
